---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---
<Layout
  title="The Armory"
  description="Darktier Studios' companion apps and utilities for board games and TTRPGs — consolidating under one roof. The Charlie Mike TOC is live."
  current="/tools"
>
  <div class="container">
    <section style="padding:84px 0 56px">
      <p class="kicker">Darktier Studios · software</p>
      <div style="display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:21px;flex-wrap:wrap">
        <h1 style="font-size:clamp(44px,6vw,84px);line-height:1.04;letter-spacing:-0.02em;margin:0 0 0 -0.06em">The armory</h1>
        <span style="font-size:13px;letter-spacing:0.22em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--color-accent)">companions &amp; tools</span>
      </div>
      <p style="font-size:16px;line-height:28px;color:color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-text) 78%, transparent);max-width:58ch;margin:28px 0 0">
        Darktier's companions and utilities for board games and TTRPGs are consolidating here — one login, one shelf, no more scattered sites. Slots below fill in as each app docks.
      </p>
    </section>
    <p class="text-muted" data-placeholder="tools">The armory loads here.</p>
  </div>
</Layout>
